To subtract $111.11$ from $333.33$, we first line up the decimal points and subtract the numbers as we would with whole numbers.
\begin{align*}
&\phantom{+}333.33\\
&-111.11\\
\cline{1-2}
&\phantom{-}222.22\\
\end{align*}
Therefore, the result is $\boxed{222.22}$.The answer is: 222.22
